---
layout: base.njk
mode: founders
permalink: /
title: "Agentic Builders — Early-stage fund for agent-native applications"
description: "We fund agent-native applications at the idea stage. $30–80k on a SAFE, a decision in four weeks. For founders who build with people and agents."
include_faq: true
---
<!-- 1. Manifesto: every highlighted fragment links to its section -->
<section class="manifesto" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <h1 id="hero-title" class="manifesto-text">
        <span class="line">We fund <a href="#thesis">agent-native applications</a> at the <a href="#thesis">idea stage</a>.</span>
        <span class="line"><a href="#check">$30–80k</a> on a SAFE, a decision in <a href="#mondays">four weeks</a>.</span>
        <span class="line">For founders who <a href="#who">build with people and agents</a>.</span>
    </h1>
    <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn-lg" href="{{ fund.fund.apply_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apply</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="logo-strip" role="list" aria-label="Portfolio companies">
        {% for c in fund.portfolio.companies %}<li><a href="{{ c.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ c.name }}</a></li>{% endfor %}
    </ul>
</section>

<!-- 2. Thesis + who -->
<section id="thesis" class="thesis" aria-labelledby="thesis-title">
    <p class="kicker">Thesis</p>
    <p class="display scrub" data-scrub>{{ fund.thesis.lead }} {{ fund.thesis.body }}</p>
    <div class="two-col">
        {% for c in fund.thesis.categories %}
        <div>
            <h2 id="thesis-title-{{ loop.index }}" class="h-serifless">{{ c.name }}</h2>
            <p>{{ c.description }}</p>
        </div>
        {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <div id="who" class="who">
        <p class="kicker">Who we look for</p>
        <p class="display-sm{% if fund.who_we_look_for.lead | isTodo %} todo{% endif %}">{{ fund.who_we_look_for.lead }}</p>
        <ol class="five" role="list">
            {% for c in fund.who_we_look_for.criteria %}
            <li><span class="num">0{{ loop.index }}</span><strong>{{ c.name }}.</strong> <span>{{ c.detail }}</span></li>
            {% endfor %}
        </ol>
    </div>
</section>

<!-- 3. Four Mondays -->
<section id="mondays" class="mondays" aria-labelledby="mondays-title">
    <p class="kicker">The program</p>
    <h2 id="mondays-title" class="display">Four Mondays.</h2>
    <p class="lead">{{ fund.program.summary }} Apply once; our partner reads it within 24 hours, a person within three business days. Then four Mondays.</p>
    <ol class="monday-list" role="list">
        <li>
            <span class="monday-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
            <h3>Monday one</h3>
            <p>Your baseline: the key number we will follow, cash and runway, who sells. The partner toolkit opens: cloud credits, coding and app-building tools, prospecting, docs.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <span class="monday-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
            <h3>Monday two</h3>
            <p>The same short set: users, paying customers, revenue, customer conversations and how many in the US, deals, investor talks, cash. Did you reach last week's goal? What did you ship?</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <span class="monday-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
            <h3>Monday three</h3>
            <p>Same questions, plus up to three about your company. About 15 minutes. Text, voice, a screenshot or a file. Reply by Friday; we do not remind.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
            <span class="monday-num" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
            <h3>Monday four</h3>
            <p>Closing questions. Our agent summarises the four weeks: what moved, what you did yourselves, whether you answered on time. The partners decide and tell you why, either way.</p>
        </li>
    </ol>
    <p class="note">No equity, no exclusivity, no fees for the track. <span class="todo">confirm: timing promises (24 hours, 3 business days)</span></p>
</section>

<!-- 4. The check -->
<section id="check" class="check" aria-labelledby="check-title">
    <p class="kicker">The check</p>
    <h2 id="check-title" class="display-xl">{{ fund.program.terms.first_check_usd }}</h2>
    <dl class="terms">
        <div><dt>Instrument</dt><dd>{{ fund.program.terms.instrument }}, plus help setting up a Delaware company and clean documents.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Follow-on</dt><dd>{{ fund.program.terms.follow_on }}.</dd></div>
        <div><dt>After the check</dt><dd>Weekly fund meeting, 1:1s with the general partner, guilds, 400+ partner perks, introductions to the next investors when you are ready to raise.</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <p class="note todo">confirm: amounts and the follow-on wording before publishing</p>
</section>

<!-- 5. The partner who reads everything -->
<section id="partner" class="partner" aria-labelledby="partner-title">
    <p class="kicker">The partner who reads everything</p>
    <div class="mono-block">
        <p>$ agent --read application.json deck.pdf</p>
        <p>&gt; one sentence: what you do, for whom; agents for people or agents for agents</p>
        <p>&gt; five criteria, each with a quote from your materials: yes / no / unknown</p>
        <p>&gt; market and the US, traction as stated, team, red flags</p>
        <p>&gt; three questions to ask before the track</p>
        <p>&gt; no adjectives. no "innovative". no "promising".</p>
        <p>$ handoff --to partners</p>
    </div>
    <p class="lead">The fund runs on its own agents: intake, deck analysis, weekly check-ins, investment memos, portfolio tracking. Agents prepare; partners decide. Your own agent can read us too: <a href="/agents/">the page for agents</a>.</p>
    <div class="visual" aria-hidden="true">VISUAL / FUTURE: upload a deck → the application fills itself → finish the remaining fields</div>
</section>

<!-- 6. Portfolio as a typographic list -->
<section id="portfolio" class="portfolio" aria-labelledby="portfolio-title">
    <p class="kicker">Portfolio · {{ fund.portfolio.companies | length }}</p>
    <ol class="plist" role="list">
        {% for c in fund.portfolio.companies %}
        <li><a href="{{ c.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="pname">{{ c.name }}</span><span class="pline">{{ c.for_humans }}</span></a></li>
        {% endfor %}
    </ol>
</section>

<!-- 7. Questions -->
<section id="faq" class="faq" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
    <p class="kicker">Questions</p>
    {% for f in fund.faq %}
    <details>
        <summary>{{ f.q }}</summary>
        <p{% if f.a | isTodo %} class="todo"{% endif %}>{{ f.a }}</p>
    </details>
    {% endfor %}
</section>

<!-- 8. Apply -->
<section id="apply" class="apply" aria-labelledby="apply-title">
    <h2 id="apply-title" class="manifesto-text">
        <span class="line">One form.</span>
        <span class="line">Four Mondays.</span>
        <span class="line">A decision either way.</span>
    </h2>
    <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn-lg" href="{{ fund.fund.apply_url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Apply</a>
        <a class="link-arrow" href="mailto:{{ fund.fund.email }}">{{ fund.fund.email }}</a>
    </div>
    <p class="note todo">{{ fund.fund.apply_url_note }}</p>
</section>
